# Trivi Time Feature Expansion

Adding rules video upload, dynamic rules display, host link status monitoring, shareable link management with expiry/naming, session creation flow changes, and controller UI revamp with macro/micro controls.

---

## Feature Areas

### A. Host Link Status Monitor & Management
### B. Per-Episode Shareable Link Management (creation, naming, timeframe, revocation)
### C. Session Creation Flow Change (deferred session creation)
### D. Controller UI Revamp (macro/micro controls)
### E. Rules Video Upload & Dynamic Rules Display
### F. Video File Name Display

---

## Proposed Changes

### 1. API Types

#### [MODIFY] [api-types.ts](file:///Users/vedantsmacmini/Desktop/Code/game-show/lib/api-types.ts)

**Already done:**
- `RulesContent`, `RulesVideoUrl` on Episode types ✅
- `UploadRulesVideoRequest` ✅
- `HostLinkListRequest`, `HostLinkListItem`, `HostLinkRevokeRequest` ✅

**New — update `GenerateHostLinkRequest`** to match actual API (requires `ValidFrom`, `ValidTo`, `HostName`):
```ts
export interface GenerateHostLinkRequest {
  IDEpisode: string
  ValidFrom: string       // ISO date string
  ValidTo: string         // ISO date string
  HostName: string        // Name of the host receiving the link
}

export interface HostLinkResponse {
  token: string
  IDGameSession: string
  RoomCode: string
  PIN: string
  ValidFrom: string
  ValidTo: string
  HostName: string
}
```

The UI computes `ValidFrom` (current time) and `ValidTo` (current time + selected duration) client-side before sending.

