### 3. Host Link Status Monitor — Global (Header Button + Modal)

#### [MODIFY] [trivia/page.tsx](file:///Users/vedantsmacmini/Desktop/Code/game-show/app/trivia/page.tsx)

**"Link Status: X" button in header:**
- Displayed in the Trivi-Time header next to the user name
- Automatically calls `hostLinksApi.list()` on page load
- Shows count `X` of active links (filtered by `Status === "active"`)
- Disabled when `X === 0` and not loading
- On click → opens the **Host Links Modal**

**Host Links Modal (full-width table layout):**
- Table columns: Episode | Room Code | Host Name | Status | Issued | Valid Until | Time Remaining | Action
- Time Remaining: computed client-side from `ValidTo` (e.g., "3d 12h", "Expired")
- Issued: formatted `CreatedAt` date
- Each row has a **Revoke** button that:
  1. Shows inline PIN input
  2. Requires 4-digit PIN confirmation
  3. On confirm → calls `hostLinksApi.revoke()` → shows success toast → refreshes list
- Refresh button in modal header to re-fetch

**Already implemented:** ✅ (Link Status button + modal with table + revoke with PIN)

