### 4. Per-Episode Link Management — Episode Card Expansion

#### [MODIFY] [trivia/page.tsx](file:///Users/vedantsmacmini/Desktop/Code/game-show/app/trivia/page.tsx)

**Episode card changes (episodes list view):**

Each episode card gets a new **link icon button** (🔗) next to the Edit/Delete buttons. On click:
- Card expands downward with an animated section
- Fetches `hostLinksApi.list({ IDEpisode: ep.IDEpisode })` for that episode

**Expanded section contains two parts:**

**A. Link Creation Form:**
- **Link Name** — text input (friendly label)
- **Host Name** — text input (who receives the link)
- **Validity Duration** — select with 5 options:
  - 1 Day, 1 Week, 2 Weeks, 1 Month, Custom
  - Custom: shows a date picker for expiry date
- **Create Link** button → calls `hostLinksApi.generate()` with name + host + duration
- On success: shows the new link URL + PIN in a success card with copy button

**B. Active Links List (per-episode):**
- Same tabular layout as the global modal but scoped to this episode
- Columns: Room Code | Host Name | Status | Issued | Time Remaining | Revoke
- Revoke button with PIN confirmation (same pattern)

**State management:**
- `expandedEpisodeLinks: string | null` — tracks which episode card is expanded
- `episodeLinks: Record<string, HostLinkListItem[]>` — cached links per episode
- Link creation form state: `linkName`, `hostName`, `validityDuration`, `customExpiryDate`

