## Verification Plan

### Build Verification
- Run `npx next build` — must pass cleanly with no TypeScript errors

### Manual Verification
1. **Link Status Button**: Load `/trivia` → verify "Link Status: X" in header → shows correct count → disabled when 0
2. **Link Status Modal**: Click button → modal opens with table → verify columns (Episode, Room Code, Host, Status, Issued, Valid Until, Time Remaining, Revoke)
3. **Revoke from Modal**: Click Revoke → enter PIN → confirm → link removed → toast success
4. **Episode Card Expansion**: Click 🔗 icon on episode card → card expands → shows link creation form + active links list
5. **Link Creation Form**: Fill in Link Name, Host Name, select 1 Week → Create → new link appears with URL + PIN
6. **Custom Expiry**: Select Custom → date picker appears → pick date → create link
7. **Per-Episode Links**: Verify only links for that episode are shown
8. **Session Creation**: Click episode → goes to orchestration view WITHOUT creating session → click "Create Session" → QR + room code appear
9. **Macro Controls**: Verify game flow phases displayed as progress pills (Lobby → Welcome → Rules → Questions → Break → Leaderboard → End)
10. **Micro Controls**: During active question, verify per-question step indicator (Announce → Video → Options → Timer → Answer → Grade → Next)
11. **Episode Editor**: Create/edit episode → add custom rules text → upload rules video → verify file name shows → save
12. **Gameboard**: Start session → advance to "Rules" state → verify custom rules + video side-by-side
13. **Fallback**: Create episode with no custom rules → verify default rules appear
14. **Host Links in Editor**: Verify enhanced creation form in episode editor matches per-episode card expansion

> [!NOTE]
> No automated tests exist in this project. Verification will be build check + manual testing.
